+  "observation": "expansion.probe_discovered_new_state and expansion.probe_revisited_known_state both total 2064 on the shipped arm. This is a COINCIDENCE of the roster sum, not two views of one quantity.",
+  "evidence": "Per game the two diverge wildly and in both directions -- ar25 190 vs 3, ls20 215 vs 17, lf52 6 vs 201, sp80 31 vs 164 -- see the per_game block. They are also computed from different signals: 'discovered' from growth in the explorer's node graph across the next decision, 'revisited' from a raw frame hash that changed while the node did not.",
+  "why_flagged_here": "Two distinct metrics agreeing exactly is the TAUTOLOGY pattern adversarial_verify.py hunts, and a reader is entitled to suspect a bug. Recorded rather than left for someone to trip over."
